 "brief": "The Palestinian Ahrar movement denounced Israeli occupation forces for what it called daily war crimes in Gaza, including airstrikes targeting civilian vehicles and infrastructure, Shehab Wire reported. The movement characterized the attacks as part of a systematic effort to eliminate all means of livelihood in the enclave.\n\nAhrar called the recent aerial bombardment of civilian transport vehicles an escalation of crimes against Palestinian civilians and accused Israel of pursuing a strategy to destroy Gaza's basic services and economic capacity.",
